{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：19:07 2026-09-13 HKT</p>\n<p>韓國人氣女團BABYMONSTER今日（13日）現身尖沙咀1881出席潮牌旗艦店開幕活動，同場還有「最美星二代」沈月，過千MONSTIEZ（BABYMONSTER粉絲暱稱）帶同應援物品到場支持，更迫滿3層廣場見偶像，場面非常墟冚。而MONSTIEZ為見偶像，昨晚已前來排隊等候，而大會在早上派完900個粉絲區的籌。現場附近亦有大批警員及交通警到場維持秩序。</p>\n<img alt=\"韓國人氣女團BABYMONSTER現身尖沙咀1881出席潮牌旗艦店開幕活動。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/1389465eeba0cfc775a2ebe23a65fcb5/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-13_at_6_28_37_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\" BABYMONSTER準時在6點現身。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/4b828987922a8944a0441ab4c41c3915/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-13_at_6_28_53_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"BABYMONSTER甫出場，引來全場粉絲起哄尖叫。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/518b87ed5b2322742cff89e9052a7b4c/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-13_at_6_28_54_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"BABYMONSTER被安排與品牌公仔一起影合照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/b27088bf0f14186fe3784e0e8bebef18/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-13_at_6_28_35_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"成員們向粉絲揮手。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/579ab6f90a78539c485fc8c93867136a/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-13_at_6_28_36_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"又大派心心！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/2d743884abac8540b3405305f1d551d9/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-13_at_6_29_15_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"粉絲迫滿3層廣場見偶像！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/119b84329b2f8ccaf103530b2822ac7d/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-13_at_6_28_29_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"現場附近亦有大批警員及交通警到場維持秩序。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/aaddd302fe871ab38d51741639adc0b9/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-13_at_6_28_30_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"現場非常墟冚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/aa178b411c828a7e8b3acd9a96396199/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-13_at_6_28_31_PM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"MONSTIEZ（粉絲暱稱）為見偶像，昨晚已前來排隊等候。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/9242d5042d1bb9556c1667729795e7a6/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-13_at_6_28_31_PM_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"MONSTIEZ（粉絲暱稱）為見偶像，昨晚已前來排隊等候。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/2a1805442bad18c5d116c08b6dbbc231/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-13_at_6_28_31_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"一眾粉絲拎齊應援物品等候BABYMONSTER。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/8d265ea4d2402a5c9fee60bb8e609e05/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-13_at_6_28_56_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<h2>BABYMONSTER以英文自我介紹</h2>\n<p>BABYMONSTER準時在6點現身，甫出場引來全場粉絲起哄尖叫，之後她們被安排與品牌公仔一起影合照，而期間亦識做地做出揮手、派飛吻及派心甫士冧粉絲，她們隨後以英文介紹自己，又表示好開心今日能在這裏見到大家，之後她們便離場，全程3分鐘。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-13T11:18:24.522824+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":342,"images":12,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}